{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[locale]/layout,_N_T_/[locale]/(site)/layout,_N_T_/[locale]/(site)/help/layout,_N_T_/[locale]/(site)/help/page,_N_T_/en/help"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$d$locale/!KHNpdGUp/help/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/2d6486a2c3fd7528caa959a0935250e1535d81ad0ef8f80222cb9ee2dfccdf84/$/en/help","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/[locale]/(site)/help/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"_0bjUvq_variable hHfarW_variable\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/07c7676b89ed2778-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/f5e6f786bcaa2be4-s.p.30d2r2x65bwdm.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/brand/logo.svg\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/17tymn_qegvh9.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1x6obpmlu1_c2.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2r4s4h5xul1n-.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3wbm-994r45kr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2e268anpfvdoc.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3-ry682tkyiqk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0umf92h1sb77c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2n5qeheznvl4u.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1_miqk4gqcfj7.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Albarza — The best AI video generator for creators</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Create cinematic, high quality videos from text prompts or image references using industry leading AI models.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/brand/logo.svg\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-40\"><div class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-12\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" href=\"/en\"><img src=\"/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"32\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wide\">Albarza</span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium lg:flex\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/image-generator\">AI Image<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/video-generator/veo-3-1\">AI Video<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">AI Editor</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">Explore</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">Templates</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-medium\"><a hrefLang=\"ar\" class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white\" href=\"/ar\">العربية</a><a class=\"hidden hover:text-gold-hi sm:block\" href=\"/en/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/login\">Sign in</a><a class=\"btn btn-gold !px-6\" href=\"/en/signup\">Sign Up</a></div></div></header><main class=\"pt-32\"><div class=\"section max-w-3xl py-0 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold\">Help Center</h1><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted\">Quick answers to the most common questions. Can&#x27;t find what you need? Contact us.</p></div><section class=\"section max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"mt-10 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><details class=\"group py-5\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What is Albarza&#x27;s AI video generator?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Albarza&#x27;s AI Video Generator turns text prompts and images into short video clips and lets you compare multiple video models in one workspace. Start with a clear brief, generate a first result, and refine the detail that needs improvement.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I generate a video from an image?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Upload a photo or choose an image from your previous sessions, add a text prompt, adjust your settings, and click Generate. You can control the start and end frames of each clip. A short, specific prompt is usually enough for a clean first result.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Can I use AI-generated videos in commercial projects?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Yes, as long as they comply with Albarza&#x27;s Terms of Use and UAE law. Use cases include client work, social media content, ads, and marketing campaigns.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What rights do I have over AI-generated videos?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">You keep full rights to the videos you create. You are free to use, modify, distribute, and monetize them, subject to the License and Terms of Use. Albarza does not claim ownership of your generated content.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Are my video outputs used to train AI models?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">No. Albarza does not use your prompts, uploads, or generated videos to train AI models. All outputs are private and protected under strict security standards and the UAE PDPL.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What AI video models are available?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">The model picker includes Seedance, Veo, Kling, Wan, Sora, and others. Compare duration, resolution, audio support, and credit cost, then test the same brief in two models.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I write a prompt for an AI video?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Describe the subject, action, setting, shot size, camera movement, and lighting. Example: “A red bicycle rolls along a coastal road at sunrise; steady side-tracking shot, soft golden light.” Review the clip and revise the detail that missed your intent.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Can I turn a photo into an AI video?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Yes. Add the photo as Start Image in the Video workspace, describe the subject&#x27;s movement and camera direction, and choose a model. Review the preview and settings before generating.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How are AI video generations charged?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Albarza shows the credit cost before you generate. Select the model and settings, review the displayed amount, and confirm. Prices are in AED, inclusive of VAT.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I choose between AI video models?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Use the same short prompt, aspect ratio, and source image in two models. Compare motion quality, subject consistency, audio support, duration, resolution, and cost. Choose the output that fits the final channel.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"pb-20 text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/en/contact\">Contact us</a></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] 